     "n": 2,
     "style": "warn",
     "title": "Let go",
     "text": "3 kΩ × 90 pF = <b>270 ns</b>. The wire's own capacitance holds the level."
    },
    {
     "from": 33.43,
     "to": 40.690000000000005,
     "anchor": [
