   "say": [
    {
     "at": 0.8,
     "text": "How long may the pad wait before it samples? Too early, and a low bit has not fallen yet. Too late, and a high bit has drained away."
    },
    {
     "at": 11.48,
     "text": "On a Hitec D485HW, every read passed with the sample 40 to 213 nanoseconds after the release. At 267 nanoseconds, none did."
    },
    {
     "at": 21.49,
     "text": "The simulation places the edge in the same spot: the released wire crosses the input threshold 250 nanoseconds after the release."
    },
    {
     "at": 31.94,
     "text": "The firmware samples at 113 nanoseconds, the middle of the window."
    },
    {
     "at": 37.73,
     "text": "With these values, 133 of 133 reads of 19 registers passed, the same values Hitec's own programmer reads."
    }
